infographic hierarchy-tree-curved-line-rounded-rect-node
data
  root
    label Eviction policy — which entry to sacrifice when full
    children
      - label LRU — least recently used
        desc Bets recency predicts reuse. Matches temporal locality. The sensible default.
      - label LFU — least frequently used
        desc Bets popularity predicts reuse. A one-off scan can't evict perennially-hot keys.
      - label FIFO — first in, first out
        desc Ignores access; evicts oldest inserted. Can drop your most valuable early item (the hook's bug).
      - label Random — arbitrary entry
        desc No bookkeeping, so cheap. Robust against a pathological scan that defeats strict LRU.
theme
  palette #6366f1 #14b8a6 #f59e0b #f43f5e
